	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Usage

ipgeo example.com: query IP or domain geolocation.
myip: show local/public IP and public geolocation.
copyip: copy local/public IPv4/IPv6.

Enter copies selected row. Command-Enter copies all info where available.

Based on Raycast IP Geolocation extension at commit 870667fc671801a467deb7c4c7fc72992efe3820.</string>
